  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The average translational kinetic energy of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> gas molecules at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mo>&#8728;</mo></mmultiscripts></math> becomes equal to the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>.</mo></math> of an electron accelerated from rest through a potential difference of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>volt</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>(Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> (Fill the nearest integer).</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "500",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given</p><p>Translation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math> of electron</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>773</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>773</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>273</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p>"
